                                                "sense_id": "631831ad-6426-319d-a3cd-a76eb1883620",
                                                "text": "There is an hour or two, after the passengers have embarked, which is disquieting and fussy. Mail bags, so I understand, are being put on board. Stewards, carrying cabin trunks, swarm in the corridors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
